OL,3,GNEWSAEx-MHK's son in and deputy speaker
OL,4,Aout in election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom an actor and ex-MHK's son, to a
OL,7,Ftreasury minister and the songwriter
OL,8,Fbehind pop anthem So Macho, there was a
OL,9,Fmixed field standing in Douglas
OL,10,FCentral.
OL,12,FIn a nation where party politics does
OL,13,Fnot dominate, the seat also saw four of
OL,14,Fthe eight candidates representing
OL,15,Fparties - although none of them won a
OL,16,Fseat.
OL,18,FTopping the poll was Peter Shimmin -
OL,19,Fson of former MHK John Shimmin - and
OL,20,Fthe second seat went to treasury
OL,21,Fminister Chris Thomas.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
